VexSign — on-device iOS IPA signer
https://github.com/iamsmmh/VexSign

VexSign-exclusive features (on top of the Feather base):
- IPA Explorer (edit Info.plist, files and images inside any IPA)
- File Transfer Server (HTTP / WebDAV)
- Live Activities & Dynamic Island for downloads
- Auto Cleanup pipeline
- Batch Signing & Update All
- Backup & Restore (.vexbackup)
- Logs & built-in File Manager

Bundle ID:   com.vexsign.app
